        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                "word": "autarcique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6170cec6-6768-451a-8ec7-fb25ae8297ed",
                        "entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "autarciques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                        "entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui se suffit à soi-même."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "316509da-c598-4570-a390-eef86a35cc0a",
                                "sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                                "text": "Un des slogans des économies autarciques (on disait naguère économies fermées) est : Ne rien perdre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b677223-ed37-49f6-86fc-b313b8375f82",
                                "sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                                "text": "Poursuite de la mondialisation ou repli autarcique ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39303f94-d50a-4337-93c3-68e7a430128b",
                                "sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                                "text": "Mais le gouvernement de Xi Jinping oriente son pays dans une voie de plus en plus autarcique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85ade479-03a3-4f6c-adc8-225e22eaef38",
                                "sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                                "text": "Lors de son premier mandat, le président américain avait indexé sa réussite au cours de la Bourse à New York. Il n’en est désormais plus question pour le milliardaire, obnubilé par sa stratégie de moins d’État et de toute-puissance autarcique, quitte à mettre l’économie de son pays en péril."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de8f84f3-4f22-4f0c-a78d-d8982a196daa",
                        "source_entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-sufficient",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-sufficient",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0f1cb1c-dc09-3b29-a90e-ad76cfd2e0e6",
                                        "entry_id": "477f6141-1092-3f87-a6af-a105d571444c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Able to provide for oneself independently of others; not needing external support."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ea96199-0f46-4748-8c94-1d07fa3125b9",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f1cb1c-dc09-3b29-a90e-ad76cfd2e0e6",
                                                "text": "Over the next few decades, several million humans immigrated to Eden Prime and a primarily agrarian culture developed. The new colony quickly became not only self-sufficient, but began exporting goods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9882c6e7-de4b-381d-8142-381b1a18f33f",
                                        "entry_id": "477f6141-1092-3f87-a6af-a105d571444c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overconfident in one's own abilities; arrogant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b9eeb66-46b6-4689-a33f-38b9aa8a54ad",
                                                "sense_id": "9882c6e7-de4b-381d-8142-381b1a18f33f",
                                                "text": "In spite of these conscientious reflections, he was too self-sufficient to think he should find any difficulty in obtaining forgiveness for these sins of omission […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44a2cc80-ea5c-4a2f-a64a-b46201b5cd92",
                                                "sense_id": "9882c6e7-de4b-381d-8142-381b1a18f33f",
                                                "text": "To rescue London from this short-termism, Byford has put forward a deal that would fill the current gap of £500m annually, explaining: \"If we can fill that gap, we can get back to being self-sufficient by 2023.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6727433-e8a0-460c-8b24-a69867ff5817",
                        "source_entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-supporting",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-supporting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40f4f066-908a-3f85-b2ad-af7d5e2745f7",
                                        "entry_id": "33b21f53-b9be-3b52-8aa9-b47a3a8b53b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by self-support."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0250295f-7e59-4c76-b8c0-298cd14e00c0",
                                                "sense_id": "40f4f066-908a-3f85-b2ad-af7d5e2745f7",
                                                "text": "With a self-supporting body and without separate underframe, this design offers scope for improved sound insulation; [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46eef05b-cff9-4ec5-b4a8-292b07ebb4fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                        "target_lang_word": "autarkic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autarkic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b590ab8e-f114-3165-b857-1009362be31d",
                                        "entry_id": "b8656677-abf8-3e44-b1c2-d61c31487008",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to an autarky; self-sufficient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9089cea-30fd-4538-bbc6-239945c5bd04",
                                                "sense_id": "b590ab8e-f114-3165-b857-1009362be31d",
                                                "text": "The countryside, in short, was becoming more archaic and more autarkic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e878ad6d-cdda-4a10-b427-edb75b5a0315",
                                                "sense_id": "b590ab8e-f114-3165-b857-1009362be31d",
                                                "text": "Fascists had no particular economic doctrine aside from preparing for war. They wanted to build autarkic economies that could withstand blockade and did not rely on foreign trade except for bilateral deals with weaker countries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9686a160-7a33-4a49-a924-473a90ff1dfc",
                        "source_entry_id": "f90bad1d-8173-31e0-9128-8763785d65ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "f161e929-2d50-37c4-b033-a5475baaa723",
                        "target_lang_word": "αυτάρκης",
                        "target_lang_code": "el",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "αυτάρκης",
                                "target_lang_code": "el",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08c7eacd-556d-36da-862c-abec6b01dfe0",
                                        "entry_id": "5ee48eb2-713c-3a10-88e2-19cc7cf54217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "που ικανοποιεί μόνος του τις ανάγκες του"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e64da35-06a0-48a6-bbfe-208af04a540b",
                                                "sense_id": "08c7eacd-556d-36da-862c-abec6b01dfe0",
                                                "text": "※ Κάποτε, σε μυθιστόρημα συγγραφέα που δε θυμάται το όνομά του, είχε διαβάσει τη φράση «Τελικά ο Αυνάν ήταν αυτάρκης». Τον είχε εντυπωσιάσει τότε η φράση εκείνη. Μπορεί και να του απενοχοποιούσε εφηβικές παρασπονδίες. (Μάνος Κοντολέων, Κόντρα ρόλος, εκδ. Πατάκης, 2025)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9bbaf95-8a89-443d-b8dc-6832c9c2939a",
                                                "sense_id": "08c7eacd-556d-36da-862c-abec6b01dfe0",
                                                "text": "※ «Γιάννη, Αδερφέ μου, Φιλάρα!» τον αγκάλιασε πασίχαρος με τα δρακόντεια χέρια του ο κουστουμαρισμένος κι απόλυτα αυτάρκης τώρα πια Πανάρετος. (Αλέξης Πάρνης, Ο άλλος Εμφύλιος, 2014 https://www.google.gr/books/edition/%CE%9F_%CE%AC%CE%BB%CE%BB%CE%BF%CF%82_%CE%95%CE%BC%CF%86%CF%8D%CE%BB%CE%B9%CE%BF%CF%82/d331BQAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=%22%CF%86%CE%B9%CE%BB%CE%AC%CF%81%CE%B1%22&pg=PT267&printsec=frontcover)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
